																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"685268529568553910","clan_steamid":"103582791471145455","event_name":"Live Update 2.3.0","event_type":13,"appid":1808500,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793095680,"rtime32_end_time":1793100601,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"d83e9772d2413cca7f5104dad21043678ca46fc9.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"481d35184f9573228d64e933243151d015e9d0a0.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"685268529568553911","clanid":"41624047","posterid":"0","headline":"Live Update 2.3.0","posttime":1793095244,"updatetime":1793096097,"body":"[p]Raiders!\n[\/p][p]Update 2.3 is rolling out right now with the Noxious Set, a number of fixes and a new player project! Please restart the game to download.\n[\/p][p]Since Frozen Trail has released, we have been including fixes in our weekly updates. After today we will go back to the regular schedule of fixes every three weeks and store updates on a weekly basis.[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/41624047\/86399b4f6b6334b548e3d9195737413e8ab082a6.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][h2]New Player Project: Souls Offering[\/h2][p]While the four contradas of Toledo can\u2019t agree on much, one thing they all have in common are the losses they\u2019ve suffered topside. As brutal stories from Pendola Pass trickle into the cantinas, Celeste is encouraging members of Speranza to pause and honor the fallen. Remember each fallen Raider for who they were, and the dents they were able to make in ARC\u2019s onslaught. Each offering is unique, but all who pause in reverence share in their Soul\u2019s Offering.\u00a0[\/p][p]\n[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/41624047\/8f89d162e867fd5eb9998fba36a88661bddcea67.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][p][\/p][h2][b]Content and Bug Fixes[\/b][\/h2][h2][b]ARC[\/b][\/h2][list][*][p]Adjusted loot distribution in the Emperor. Containers near the entrance now yield lower-tier rewards, with higher-tier loot placed deeper inside.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed a case where rolling enemies would continue to lay tracks after they died.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Improved the way ARC move when they are close to the borders of the map.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where players could stand on the Skulker indefinitely.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Adjusted Vaporizer debris so they no longer fly away or jitter; responses now better match their weight and size.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Added new visual hatches to make it easier to see how far the Frigate puzzle has progressed.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed missing collision on the Frigate that allowed players to enter or hide inside geometry, and prevented players getting stuck on the wings.[\/p][\/*][\/list][h2][b]Animation[\/b][\/h2][list][*][p]Minor animation adjustment to the Bull Rush skill\u2019s camera animation on hit.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where magazines did not eject during reloads on Bettina, Bobcat, and Kettle.[\/p][\/*][\/list][h2][b]Audio[\/b][\/h2][list][*][p]Added clearer audio cues on the Frigate\u2019s power core vents and hatches to better signal progression, completion, and destruction states.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Added sound effects when picking up and placing furniture in the Outpost, including when returning furniture to its original slot.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Refined audio for Outpost crafting, placement, progress, and removal.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where cloth would not simulate correctly.[\/p][\/*][\/list][h2][b]Gameplay[\/b][\/h2][p][b]General[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where downed Raiders continued to lose health after entering the Ballistic Gondola.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Increased Heavy Shield base charge value from 80 to 90.[\/p][list][*][p]Dev Note: We experimented with some small buffs to the Heavy Shield in the 2.0 update, and the data is showing us that the durability drain rate in particular showed marked changes. The usage rates for this shield are still relatively low, so we\u2019re giving it another little bump, this time in the base charge value. This will slightly increase survivability against most weapons, without creating too large a margin between the Heavy and Medium Shields. We will continue to monitor the use of our various low-use equipment to try and find a balance that works for both usability and the overall game health, and will be monitoring this change closely for any unintended changes to overall combat balance.[\/p][\/*][\/list][\/*][*][p]When on or near the Frigate, pings now mark the exact location instead of labeling the Frigate.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Expanded on the exploit prevention feature used in locked rooms to provide a more fair experience inside the Emperor.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Blocked placing barricade kits where they intersect with solid walls or in spaces that are too tight.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Tweaked killboxes at the top of the compactor inside the Emperor in Pendola Pass to eliminate some scenarios where players would be unfairly killed.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where heavy landings weren\u2019t being triggered correctly when dodgerolling or when already in a heavy landing.and where retriggering a\u00a0 heavy landing during a Dodge Roll could negate fall damage; heavy landings now trigger correctly while rolling.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where Scrappy would rotate in the Outpost outside of customization.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where Scrappy would not appear in the Outpost until entering the Workshop or customization.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Frigate[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]You can now ping the Frigate from long range while it is entering the area.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Adjusted loot distribution so areas further in have a higher chance of higher-tier rewards;\u00a0[\/p][\/*][*][p]Updated the cargo gate to a newer version.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\n[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/41624047\/d631384e275dc5f5da1f4be2758370f344cc9fe1.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][h3][b]Items[\/b][\/h3][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where mines could be placed on dismantling barricades, causing them to float in midair.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where fire from Flame Spray could pass through a wall.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Increased Flame Spray damage to 13\/s (from 10\/s) and reduced durability drain by 50%.[\/p][\/*][*][p]The Firefly Burner now activates on impact when thrown, traveling while leaving a trail of fire before exploding after about 3 seconds. Previously, it had to be shot to vent fire.[\/p][\/*][*][p]You can now use Adrenaline Shot even at max stamina. Its effect no longer stacks; using another Adrenaline Shot refreshes the duration.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed inverted drop rates for furniture Designs; rarer items now drop less frequently.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Dolabra, Bobcat, Equalizer, Jupiter, Tempest, and Vulcano blueprints can now drop in any major map condition. Slightly lowered the drop chance of that pool to account for the increased value.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Reduced the drop chance of the Emperor Key blueprint from Redirection pods, and added a small chance to find ARC parts and high-tier ARC loot to compensate.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Grappling Hook[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where the Grappling Hook could not be used inside the Matriarch\u2019s shield while it was active.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Tether items now affect players swinging from the grappling hook.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where the Grappling Hook could launch players at extreme speeds or into the air when the line snagged on geometry, reducing unintended launches and falls.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Grappling hook now reattaches to debris when its target breaks apart, improving reliability when grappling destroyed ARC parts.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where reeling an ARC with the Grappling Hook while the rope was wrapped around an obstacle pulled it toward the player instead of the wrap point; targets now reel toward the rope as intended, preventing unintended high\u2011speed launches.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue that allowed reeling in the Grappling Hook while firing was blocked, which could also corrupt the animation during a Dodge Roll.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed a bug where the hand animation could get stuck after swapping from a thrown Grappling Hook to another item.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Camera[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Added Color Push and Black & White filters to the advanced Camera.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Refined the film grain texture on the Classic Film filter.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Reduced depth-of-field blur on the Basic Camera to make selfies clearer.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Zipline[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where entering a zipline from the ground would not move the character upward, making attachments behave oddly. Characters now move upward correctly on entry.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where the Zipline preview cable could disappear when aiming at very long distances.[\/p][\/*][\/list][h2][b]Map[\/b][\/h2][p][b]Pendola Pass[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed multiple collision issues around the fallen Emperor in Pendola Pass to reduce getting stuck, missing collisions, and unintended out-of-bounds access.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where players could sometimes clip through the gondola extraction on Pendola Pass.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed missing ceiling collision in the Fallen Emperor on Pendola Pass that allowed players to leave the playable space.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Removed chairs in a shelter that could block looting due to collision issues.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Improved the placement of some containers inside the Storm Huts of Pendola Pass, which also fixes an issue with one of them where a Medical Bag could be interacted with through a wall.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue with an ammo box in Pendola Pass not being interactable.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Spaceport[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed an issue on Spaceport where players could get stuck when trying to pass through a small fence gap.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Stella Montis[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed various locations on Stella Montis where players could get stuck.[\/p][\/*][\/list][h2][b]Performance[\/b][\/h2][list][*][p]Updated FidelityFX Super Resolution (FSR) plugin to version 4.1.1.[\/p][\/*][\/list][h2][b]Quest[\/b][\/h2][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where Daily Quests did not refresh in the menus after they expired.[\/p][\/*][\/list][h2][b]Stability[\/b][\/h2][list][*][p]Reduced audio memory usage on Xbox Series S to improve stability and mitigate out-of-memory crashes, particularly when navigating around the Frigate.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue that could cause players to get stuck in the tunnel sequence after finishing a round; a failsafe now returns you to the front end if the end-of-round survey screen fails to load.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Added a workaround that mitigates a ray tracing related GPU crash on AMD RX 7000 series GPUs.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Reduced memory usage for the Frigate to address rare crashes when exploring its cargo hold with larger groups.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Improved stability when exploring the Frigate, reducing the chance of crashes.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed a rare crash that could occur while using voice chat, improving overall voice chat stability.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/41624047\/93fa17e2d6115a4776ab48c816c412e79763912d.jpg\"][\/img][\/p][h2][b]UI[\/b][\/h2][p][b]General[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]We will be disabling the Expedition Vault and you will receive Bronze Statuettes as compensation for the purchased slots. Everything you had in the Vault will be moved to your stash.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where the HUD did not show the correct controller input hint for the Raider Tool and melee; it now displays the appropriate icon and Hold indicator based on your binding.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Camera HUD now extends to the edges of widescreen displays for a cleaner full-screen view.[\/p][\/*][*][p]The End of Round screen now correctly shows attached Weapon Mods and applied Stencils; tooltips correctly display applied Stencil info.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where the mouse cursor could become confined to a small area after using the radial wheel with a controller, causing restricted cursor movement in inventory and looting interfaces when switching between mouse and controller.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Added animated transitions and a subtle glint effect to collection items in menus to improve visual feedback.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Unified On\/Off toggle order in outfit customization: ON now appears first and OFF last across all items.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Added a camera bob option in Gameplay settings.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where the health bar could display a healing preview while downed.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Codex[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Fixed an issue where the selected Codex entry could be cut off in the sidebar; the selected entry now remains visible when scrolling.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Added a \u201cTimes Revived By A Stranger\u201d stat to the Codex player stats page.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed an issue where the Codex entry for \u201cBilguun\u2019s Hideout\u201d did not unlock after visiting it on Spaceport.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Updated the Basic and Advanced Camera tooltips to clarify where saved photos can be viewed in the Codex.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Outpost[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Improved framing of Outpost furniture icons for clearer previews.[\/p][\/*][*][p]When placing furniture in the Outpost, camera cycling now skips views that don\u2019t show a compatible slot for the selected item.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Fixed a camera issue at the Workshop Bench slot near the Outpost door that caused the view to clip through the wall.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Reward Pass[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Improved the Reward Pass upgrade screen: standardized panel heights, adjusted padding, and capitalized \"Includes:\"; list items are larger to better support longer translations.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Updated the Reward Pass screen: improved the Feats panel layout, renamed Daily Feats to Feats and Weekly Bonus to Milestones, and refined timers for better readability.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Weapon Amplification[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]In the Amplification tree, branch points now list the specific amplifications they would block in the tooltip, replacing the generic exclusivity message.[\/p][\/*][*][p]The Amplify button in the Weapon Bench upgrade tab now shows its keybind when using keyboard and mouse.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Project[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Resolved cases where the yellow dot on the Projects tab persisted after checking or starting projects.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][b]Workshop[\/b][\/p][list][*][p]Reordered the Workshop subnavigation to match the tile order, placing Basic Workbench immediately after Scrappy.[\/p][\/*][\/list][h2][b]VFX[\/b][\/h2][list][*][p]Improved volumetric smoke visuals by reducing jitter and ensuring effects align more accurately with smoke density, resulting in more stable and coherent VFX[\/p][\/*][*][p]Improvements to skin shading.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Improved one of our ambient occlusion techniques that should significantly reduce ghosting and flickering of ambient occlusion in some areas[\/p][\/*][*][p]Added missing downwash visual effects when the Ballistic Gondola takes off.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Improved lighting on Frigates by preserving global illumination to prevent overly dark interiors.[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][\/p][h2]Known Issues[\/h2][list][*][p]The Raider Tool has the default skin even when other skins are equipped.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Extracting with partial progress of \u2018To The Skies\u2019 quest may result in an inability to complete it.[\/p][\/*][*][p]\u2018When Everything Falls\u2019 - some quest objectives, such as \u201cPhotograph Port A\u201d may not complete for some players.[\/p][\/*][*][p]In some instances, if players lose or sell quest items, such as the Equatorial Sundial needed for \u2018Clean Hands\u2019, the quest cannot be completed.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Some XBOX players may experience instability or crashes.[\/p][\/*][*][p]ARC Reclaimers can occasionally fail to dock on the appropriate spot on the Frigate.[\/p][\/*][*][p]When vaulting on an ARC Reclaimer, the player can be mistakenly pushed off.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Occasionally, some weapon models may increase in size dramatically during a raid.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Falling while using the Grappling Hook can cause the player to \u201cbounce\u201d high into the air.[\/p][\/*][*][p]There is a spot around the Railroad on Pendola Pass where players can get stuck.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]See you Topside,[\/p][p]The ARC Raiders Team[\/p][p]\n[\/p]","commentcount":771,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1866137740_1793096646_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"572679123738037989","event_gid":"685268529568553910","voteupcount":2045,"votedowncount":273,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"572679123738037989","rtime32_last_modified":1793173728,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793096646,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793091971,"votes_up":2043,"votes_down":272,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"3199242034531739976","gidfeature2":"572679123738037989"},{"gid":"708911159562997226","clan_steamid":"103582791471145455","event_name":"PvE Toggle Beta Test: October 13-20","event_type":35,"appid":1808500,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1791895800,"rtime32_end_time":1792486800,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"fbfbf03ebdd23258b5acd0a0beed54a83d6db0d5.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"43ce8a9098cb30a755bce47559e7b0946dc47abf.jpg\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"708911159562997227","clanid":"41624047","posterid":"0","headline":"PvE Toggle Beta Test: October 13-20","posttime":1791895850,"updatetime":1791895850,"body":"[p]Raiders,\u00a0[\/p][p]From October 13 (11:00 CEST) - 20 (11:00 CEST), we will be testing a PvE matchmaking toggle in ARC Raiders. Back in September, we gave some general info about [url=\"https:\/\/arcraiders.com\/news\/pve-toggle-beta-test\"]why we are testing this now[\/url], and we recommend reading that if you haven't done so already.[\/p][p]Before the toggle goes live, we want to remind you what the test will mean for you as a player:[\/p][h1]What to know[\/h1][p]The PvE matchmaking toggle will allow players to switch between the standard PvPvE experience and the new PvE servers. In PvE servers, there will be a few changes to the experience:[\/p][list][*][p]Zero player-to-player damage.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Throwable items including stun and fire items will not work on other players.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][*][p]All other physical interaction items like barricades and ziplines will be unaffected.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][*][p]Overall loot value in PvE servers will be lowered.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Squad separation will not be prioritized, so different size groups will meet more often.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][*][p]Certain major map conditions will not offer PvE as an option including Night Raid, Locked Gate, Hidden Bunker, Frigate, and Redirection.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][*][p]ARC enemies may re-acquire downed players. There is an eight second grace period after being downed in which players will not be acquired by ARC, but they may attack if they catch you moving after that period.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][*][p]Matchmaking times may be affected in low-population regions and during quiet hours, but we will be monitoring this closely to ensure everyone is served good sessions.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][*][p]Our standard matchmaking will continue to apply during PvPvE sessions. This will help us gather strong data about how a PvE toggle affects PvPvE sessions before we make any sweeping changes to matchmaking.\u00a0[\/p][\/*][\/list][h1]What we need from you[\/h1][p]This is a test, and to get the very best data, we need you to play, experience the changes, and leave us as much feedback as possible. If you are a primarily PvE inclined player who wants to see PvE systems implemented in future, we need you to help us understand what is and isn\u2019t working.\u00a0[\/p][p]This goes for other players too; if you only see yourself playing the standard PvPvE experience, please continue to play and let us know how (if at all) the toggle is impacting your experience.\u00a0[\/p][p]After the test has concluded, we will send out a survey where you can offer more detailed feedback about your experience and where you would like to see the PvE option go next.[\/p][p][\/p][p]We\u2019re looking forward to seeing you there![\/p][p][\/p][p]The ARC Raiders Team[\/p]","commentcount":4719,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1434278705_1791895950_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"581684930426314975","event_gid":"708911159562997226","voteupcount":18636,"votedowncount":1263,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"581684930426314975","rtime32_last_modified":1793173222,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1791895950,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1791895676,"votes_up":18636,"votes_down":1263,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"3199242034531739976","gidfeature2":"581684930426314975"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["685268529568553911","708911159562997227"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1793095680,"event_gid":"685268529568553910","announcement_gid":"685268529568553911","clan_account_id":41624047}}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				

					<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="game_area_reviews" class="game_area_description">
						<h2>Reviews</h2>
												<p>86 – <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.metacritic.com%2Fgame%2Farc-raiders%2F" target="_blank" rel=" noopener"  >Metacritic</a><br></p>
					</div>
				
				<div class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 300px;">			<div class="game_area_description" data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}">
				<h2>ARC Raiders Deluxe Edition</h2>				<p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/dd5eea9ac33a6c30b62a3ae524b67e42.avif?t=1791401542" width=1024 height=828 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >ARC Raiders Deluxe Edition includes the base game and the following content:</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The Wanderer Set, including the following cosmetic items:</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >“Valente” Outfit,</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >“Pathfinder” Backpack,</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >“Blanket Roll” Backpack Attachment.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Plus:</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Character Cosmetic,</p></li></ul><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Finger Gun Rapid Fire Emote,</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Cowboy Scrappy Body Type and Skin,</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >2 400 Raider Tokens.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p></p>
			</div>
			</div>				<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >SCAVENGE, SURVIVE, THRIVE </h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >In ARC Raiders, gameplay flows between the surface ruled by lethal machines, and the vibrant underground society of Speranza. Craft, repair, and upgrade your gear in the safety of your own workshop, before venturing topside to scavenge the remnants of a devastated but beautiful world. Play solo or in parties up to three, navigating the constant threat of ARC's machines and the unpredictable choices of fellow survivors. In the end, only you decide what kind of Raider you are - and how far you’ll go to prevail.<br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/f22cb839ef45f9106db05672412463f3.poster.avif?t=1791401542" width=780 height=252 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/f22cb839ef45f9106db05672412463f3.webm?t=1791401542" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/f22cb839ef45f9106db05672412463f3.mp4?t=1791401542" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >EXPLORE AN IMMERSIVE WORLD</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Explore four distinct maps at launch, with more to be revealed as the underground society evolves and expands its reach. Each destination carries the weight of a world twice-destroyed, and the scars of conflicts both old and new. Sift through the remnants for valuable loot, and piece together the past as it's slowly reclaimed by nature. Evolving map conditions ensure that no two runs are the same, with varying weather, enemies, and mechanics adding unpredictability and danger. <br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/138bc82b1d7cd44c7a8c1b40ff9351aa.poster.avif?t=1791401542" width=780 height=252 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/138bc82b1d7cd44c7a8c1b40ff9351aa.webm?t=1791401542" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/138bc82b1d7cd44c7a8c1b40ff9351aa.mp4?t=1791401542" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >STAKE YOUR CLAIM</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >In a society built on boldness and bravado, it is up to you to stake your claim as a Raider. The loot you scavenge can be sold for coin or crafted into all-new gear, allowing you take on increasingly lethal dangers head-on. Through both victories and hardships, you'll gain valuable experience; unlocking varied skills that enable all-new ways of play. In addition, you'll complete quests for Traders with differing motives and agendas; uncovering both the friction and comradery of a community under constant threat of collapse.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/cb5b1a7db7fc18a2443892b8f437a2e2.poster.avif?t=1791401542" width=780 height=252 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/cb5b1a7db7fc18a2443892b8f437a2e2.webm?t=1791401542" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/cb5b1a7db7fc18a2443892b8f437a2e2.mp4?t=1791401542" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >BEWARE THE MACHINES</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Lethal machines known as ARC rule the surface, ranging from unrelenting drone swarms to mechanical giants that obliterate everything in their path. Their origins remain a mystery, but their ever-present danger is felt with every step you take. Each machine comes with distinct strengths and tactics, forcing you to pinpoint their weak spots and constantly think on your feet. And remember: the noise of battle carries. Other Raiders may be listening; eager to claim what you leave behind.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" style="text-align: center"><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/bc2b5cb59b0bc6eb42ddc2ff26098545.poster.avif?t=1791401542" width=780 height=252 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/bc2b5cb59b0bc6eb42ddc2ff26098545.webm?t=1791401542" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/bc2b5cb59b0bc6eb42ddc2ff26098545.mp4?t=1791401542" type="video/mp4"></video></span></h2><h2 class="bb_tag" >FORGE YOUR OWN PATH</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Raiders survive by kitbashing scavenged materials; using long-lost tech and looted ARC parts to craft weapons, gadgets, and gear. Upgrade your workshop stations and learn blueprints to craft even more advanced items, or improvise quick fixes in the field to get yourself out of a bind. As you make a name for yourself, you'll be able to measure your skill against other Raiders by taking on Trials; rising through the leaderboards to earn valuable rewards.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/3ed7c3a1bf71024f7b8938b1b10711f9.poster.avif?t=1791401542" width=780 height=252 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/3ed7c3a1bf71024f7b8938b1b10711f9.webm?t=1791401542" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/3ed7c3a1bf71024f7b8938b1b10711f9.mp4?t=1791401542" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >QUESTS</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >In Speranza, everyone has an agenda, and the Traders are no different. They’ll send you topside on missions in exchange for rewards, slowly revealing more about who they are and what they want for Speranza’s future. Complete quests to earn gear, crafting materials, and XP to level up your Raider and unlock new skill points.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/b85286f667febcbea2f732aa222f29ce.poster.avif?t=1791401542" width=780 height=252 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/b85286f667febcbea2f732aa222f29ce.webm?t=1791401542" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/b85286f667febcbea2f732aa222f29ce.mp4?t=1791401542" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >SKILL TREE</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The ARC Raiders skill tree branches into three paths: Survival, Mobility, and Conditioning. Spend your points to shape your playstyle. Loot faster and move quieter with Survival skills. Outmaneuver your opponents and threats with Mobility. And enhance your Strength and Stamina with Conditioning. Choose how you grow and what your Raider brings to the battle. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/b20e3d75010301520237f9b904105279.poster.avif?t=1791401542" width=780 height=252 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/b20e3d75010301520237f9b904105279.webm?t=1791401542" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1808500/extras/b20e3d75010301520237f9b904105279.mp4?t=1791401542" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >BUILD YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Whether you’re preparing to take down specific ARC enemies or fend off rival Raiders, there's a choice of weaponry for every fight. Cater to your style with a range of firearms including SMGs, rifles and shotguns, as well as more advanced options such as railguns and energy weapons. Grenades, traps, ziplines and deployables offer the tactical depth needed to outsmart your enemies, while augments allow you to tailor your loadout to your preferred playstyle; unlocking dedicated inventory slots and additional gameplay perks.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" style="text-align: center"> </p>						</div>
					</div>
